WEBVTT

00:00:00.269 --> 00:00:02.829
Write a notice that matches what happened. In

00:00:02.875 --> 00:00:06.018
this fictional case, AI helped draft the work-session

00:00:06.198 --> 00:00:09.207
reminder, and a human checked wording against supplied

00:00:09.297 --> 00:00:12.755
details. It remains a simulation: no reminder was

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:16.778
sent and receipt is unconfirmed. Questions and corrections

00:00:17.182 --> 00:00:19.653
go to the designated training owner through the

00:00:19.697 --> 00:00:23.021
supplied practice route. Do not invent a contact

00:00:23.291 --> 00:00:26.748
address or response promise. Check the actual policy

00:00:27.018 --> 00:00:29.773
before using a real notice. Give people enough

00:00:29.862 --> 00:00:33.545
information to understand the assistance, relevant limit and

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:34.664
human contact.
